  "full_text": "To try and look into the, you could see glowing iron like being pounded or something. You know what I mean? Like to look into the furnace places where they got the steel ingots and stuff. And we would go see the pile drivers downtown. They had the bridge that goes to nowhere and go watch the pile drivers pound. That was pretty cool. So that was, my dad would come home and we'd go to lunch during this. And there was 4-H. My sisters were in 4-H and stuff. And apparently they did a production of Oliver and toured up into Montreal. My dad drove the bus.",
